  "description": "Operating Area: India\n\nBoarding Point: Jetty no 5, opp. Taj Mahal Hotel, Gateway of India.\n\nOne of a kind a 56 footer luxurious catamaran double hull, spaciously designed, well maintained and fully furnished with bedrooms and saloon area, falls into the category of the best sailing yacht in Mumbai Harbour.\nLagoon is a super luxurious ac yacht with a capacity of a 30 people on the yacht addition to the yacht captain and its crew.\nThe boat is well equipped with television screens, basic music system, speakers & usb ports and mobile charging facilities. On the deck, there are big sunbathing pads, and an impressive rear swim deck.\nThe front deck is the biggest and most spacious part on the yacht with 2 trampolines, seating area and chairs on the edges. The Yacht has 2 bedrooms and 2 washrooms with a fully furnished kitchen and microwave.\nThe upper fly bridge provides a dinning lounge and all the outdoor entertainment space one needs via comfortable stairs. The Italian leather upholstery in the saloon area on the yacht adds elegance along with comfort.\nA catamaran is a sturdy and strong boat, which you will enjoy in all-weather types whether you're going out just for day, or for an overnight.\nLagoon is a party yacht, great choice for a big group of 30 people whether corporate parties, celebrations on birthdays, anniversaries, pre wedding events, engagements, product launches, team building events, bachelor and spinster parties or even just a drop to a destination like Mandwa (Alibaug)\nThe two hours price on the site is only possible from Monday to Thursday, (weekend) Friday to Sunday the yacht needs to be hired for a three hour charter.\nThe above price includes a transfer boat ride to the yacht (3 hours) of sailing time and then again, one is sent back on the same transfer boat to the shore.\nPreferred Morning slots: 7 to 9 am and 8 to 10am\nEvening Slots: 2 to 4pm, 4 to 6pm, 6 to 8pm (No 5 to 7pm available)",
